@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Lấy prompt để copy sang web AI (không cần API key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vocabularies/generation/prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestedCount": 3,
  "cefrLevel": "B2",
  "topic": "Workplace communication",
  "excludedWords": []
}

### Nhập response từ web AI (ghi DB, không gọi Google API)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vocabularies/generation/import
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonText": "[{\"word\":\"resilient\",\"partOfSpeech\":\"adjective\",\"definitionEn\":\"Able to recover quickly\",\"meaningVi\":\"Kiên cường\",\"synonyms\":[\"strong\"],\"antonyms\":[\"fragile\"]}]",
  "modelCode": "manual-web-ai",
  "cefrLevel": "B2",
  "topic": "Workplace communication",
  "assignToTodayPlan": true
}
